value":"，F=ma，q=It可知，电场强度的单位是N/C=kg·m/("},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"·A·s)=kg·m/(A·"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":")．也可用排除法，因为国际单位制中的基本单位不包括N、V、C，故A、B、C错误，D正确．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q04","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c455991ee3bd4048eb120442d7e86f2350dcce996fe64a5fb31555cccc73cc66","body":[{"type":"text","value":"一辆汽车沿平直道路行驶，其v-t图象如图1所示．在t=0到t=40 s这段时间内，汽车的位移是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b7d50fa275d0df937bfa4af7b97a982f5825846399d795b0a7292fc55cf6844f.png","width":709,"height":453,"width_mm":30.06,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q04-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"30 m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"750 m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1 200 m"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】汽车通过的位移即为v-t图象与时间轴围成的面积，根据面积可知位移为x="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"×(10+40)×30 m=750 m."}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q05","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q05","number":"5","order":5,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bea2a510939eab2d2da3e629ddea962b592d92a85f787fc46ed35e8dcb3d2e58","body":[{"type":"text","value":"奥运会比赛项目撑杆跳高如图2所示，下列说法不正确的是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1bf3f20634b7bf0832e7e8cd288998579dd378be4d7622d0bfec29e922336814.png","width":908,"height":907,"width_mm":38.52,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"加速助跑过程中，运动员的动能增加"}],[{"type":"text","value":"起跳上升过程中，杆的弹性势能一直增加"}],[{"type":"text","value":"起跳上升过程中，运动员的重力势能增加"}],[{"type":"text","value":"越过横杆后下落过程中，运动员的重力势能减少动能增加"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】加速助跑过程中运动员的速度增大，动能增加，A对；起跳上升过程中杆的形变量先变大，再变小，故弹性势能先增加再减少，B错；起跳上升过程中运动员位置升高，重力势能增加，C对；越过横杆后，下落过程中运动员所受重力做正功，重力势能减少，动能增加，D对．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q06","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f4cf17f06b2143cf5d92d1489762299718d16220ec693356d22a078616de2e67","body":[{"type":"text","value":"等量异种电荷的电场线如图3所示，下列表述正确的是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f3b303cc1f0deee5b42b5be4b3e2993cfbf28bd5043a606018b18348d863528e.png","width":894,"height":503,"width_mm":37.68,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q06-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"a点的电势低于b点的电势"}],[{"type":"text","value":"a点的场强大于b点的场强，方向相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"将一负电荷从a点移到b点电场力做负功"}],[{"type":"text","value":"负电荷在a点的电势能大于在b点的电势能"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】沿电场线方向电势降低，a点的电势高于b点的电势，A错误；电场线的疏密表示电场强弱，故a点场强大于b点场强，且方向不同，B错误；负电荷的受力方向与场强方向相反，所以将一负电荷从a点移到b点电场力做负功，电势能增大，负电荷在a点的电势能小于在b点的电势能，C正确，D错误．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q07","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q07","number":"7","order":7,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d0435d4302ebef6c0f9a8f516504261fc475d6f7043ddddd00f0478b846b75a1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"电流天平是一种测量磁场力的装置，如图4所示，两相距很近的通电平行线圈Ⅰ和Ⅱ，线圈Ⅰ固定，线圈Ⅱ置于天平托盘上，当两线圈均无电流通过时，天平示数恰好为零．下列说法正确的是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7da7cc8690de45e7496af5b0e8733732a784a4b0b14a4f72d7507e422c7a06a6.png","width":1417,"height":652,"width_mm":59.9,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q07-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图4"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"当天平示数为负时，两线圈电流方向相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"当天平示数为正时，两线圈电流方向相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"线圈Ⅰ对线圈Ⅱ的作用力大于线圈Ⅱ对线圈Ⅰ的作用力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"线圈Ⅰ对线圈Ⅱ的作用力与托盘对线圈Ⅱ的作用力是一对相互作用力"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】装置的构造模型为两个线圈和一个杠杆，当线圈中通有同向电流时互相吸引，通有异向电流时互相排斥，故当天平示数为负时表示两线圈互相吸引，所以为同向电流，A正确，B错误；根据牛顿第三定律可知线圈Ⅰ对线圈Ⅱ的作用力等于线圈Ⅱ对线圈Ⅰ的作用力，由相互作用力的特点知，线圈Ⅰ对线圈Ⅱ的作用力与托盘对线圈Ⅱ的作用力不是一对相互作用力，故C、D错误．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q08","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bd889afaa86b1e120c1f33f123daa25f6cdb1e6386fc756a6e145c479aff0c2d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"电荷量为4×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{-6}"},{"type":"text","value":" C的小球绝缘固定在A点，质量为0.2 kg、电荷量为-5×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{-6}"},{"type":"text","value":" C的小球用绝缘细线悬挂，静止于B点．A、B间距离为30 cm，AB连线与竖直方向夹角为60°.静电力常量为9.0×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{9}"},{"type":"text","value":" N·"},{"type":"math","value":"m^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"math","value":"C^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，小球可视为点电荷．下列图示正确的是(g取10 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":")（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3160a48cf362dddd354a0ed05426ce7dedeac8b1cd468b93054d92621363e8e9.png","width":1404,"height":513,"width_mm":59.48,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q08-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a926bce148f792f22ba49e73f731ca53d04300cbc95323f5ec542ad6847b4021.png","width":1404,"height":605,"width_mm":59.48,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q08-row2"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"图 A"}],[{"type":"text","value":"图 B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"图 C"}],[{"type":"text","value":"图 D"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A对B的库仑力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{kq_{A}|q_{B}|}{r^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"=2 N，对B受力分析如图所示，可知A对B的库仑力与B的重力相等，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"与G的合力方向与G方向的夹角为60°，故B正确．\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3a485fe56c62a0cd178d8b27e8a24825202071ec0446867c02a3cd79d1845feb.png","width":639,"height":355,"width_mm":27.09}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q09","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d6fe1293edcea19c3b3528a4a6967cc98f2da459ece4a6e55abe2028bc5a19cd","body":[{"type":"text","value":"一质量为2.0×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" kg的汽车在水平公路上行驶，路面对轮胎的径向最大静摩擦力为1.4×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" N，当汽车经过半径为80 m的弯道时，下列判断正确的是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b0a3f9de84291355539897cba668b3735b1ee52aba958890b3a809b011eae614.png","width":827,"height":437,"width_mm":34.92,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图5"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"汽车转弯时所受的力有重力、弹力、摩擦力和向心力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"汽车转弯的速度为20 m/s时所需的向心力为1.4×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"N"}],[{"type":"text","value":"汽车转弯的速度为20 m/s时汽车会发生侧滑"}],[{"type":"text","value":"汽车能安全转弯的向心加速度不超过7.0 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】汽车转弯时所受的力有重力、弹力、摩擦力，向心力是由摩擦力提供的，A错误；汽车转弯的速度为20 m/s时，根据"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"=m"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得所需的向心力为1.0×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" N，没有超过最大静摩擦力，所以汽车不会发生侧滑，B、C错误；汽车转弯时的最大向心加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F_{f}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"=     7.0 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，D正确．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q10","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"dbc7c10fe0ef2a7b727e6c6bf3403d05e12db19a4e5578d58fd9474212ec7766","body":[{"type":"text","value":"磁流体发电的原理如图6所示，将一束速度为v的等离子体垂直于磁场方向喷入磁感应强度为B的匀强磁场中，在相距为d、宽为a、长为b的两平行金属板间便产生电压．如果把上、下板和电阻R连接，上、下板就是一个直流电源的两极，若稳定时等离子体在两板间均匀分布，电阻率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":"，忽略边缘效应，下列判断正确的是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/804c8f31a59f0361bbe931c07b53b95eace2509e7d1fc9d11b1220938c00784e.png","width":918,"height":481,"width_mm":38.95,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图6"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"上板为正极，电流I="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Bdvab}{Rab+\\rho d}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"上板为负极，电流I="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Bvad^{2}}{Rad+\\rho b}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"下板为正极，电流I="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Bdvab}{Rab+\\rho d}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"下板为负极，电流I="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Bvad^{2}}{Rab+\\rho b}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】根据左手定则可知，正离子在磁场中受到的洛伦兹力向下，故下板为正极，设两板间的电压为U，则q"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U}{d}"},{"type":"text","value":"=Bqv，得U=Bdv，电流I="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U}{R+\\rho \\frac{d}{ab}}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Bdvab}{Rab+\\rho d}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故C正确．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q11","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"225d935e2a1740912dbe3bd03b77739d2b46b765acede282a9fc1c1eba9a4343","body":[{"type":"text","value":"小明在观察如图7所示的沙子堆积时，发现沙子会自然堆积成圆锥体，且在不断堆积过程中，材料相同的沙子自然堆积成的圆锥体的最大底角都是相同的．小明测出这堆沙子的底部周长为31.4 m，利用物理知识测得沙子之间的动摩擦因数为0.5，估算出这堆沙的体积最接近("},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi"},{"type":"text","value":"取3.14)（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a1e455ae56816cea57f304e744162749ff4832551f98873fe99076b075ac95c4.png","width":945,"height":484,"width_mm":40.01,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图7"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"60"},{"type":"math","value":"m^{3}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"200"},{"type":"math","value":"m^{3}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"250"},{"type":"math","value":"m^{3}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"500"},{"type":"math","value":"m^{3}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】沙堆底部的周长为31.4 m，可知底面半径为R=5 m，由图可知当沙堆不能再堆高时即μ=tan "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"=0.5，此时沙堆的高h=Rtan "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"=2.5 m，故沙堆的体积为V="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{3}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi"},{"type":"math","value":"R^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"h"},{"type":"math","value":"\\approx"},{"type":"text","value":"65.4 "},{"type":"math","value":"m^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故选项A正确．\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/368b74ec7e5e1bab8846e411e3ebfd84d29e8f656e95873c89e7999b9afa314b.png","width":709,"height":456,"width_mm":30.06}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q12","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"267bfbad50ec2dfd21d4d51b92d1c7ec776be7dc7dc0521da7df76265b2a0672","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20世纪人类最伟大的创举之一是开拓了太空的全新领域．现有一艘远离星球在太空中直线飞行的宇宙飞船，为了测量自身质量，启动推进器，测出飞船在短时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta"},{"type":"text","value":"t内速度的改变量为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta"},{"type":"text","value":"v，和飞船受到的推力F(其它星球对它的引力可忽略)．飞船在某次航行中，当它飞近一个孤立的星球时，飞船能以速度v，在离星球的较高轨道上绕星球做周期为T的匀速圆周运动．已知星球的半径为R，引力常量用G表示，则宇宙飞船和星球的质量分别是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d6edf2e9c38cb0900018c9388b638987f3dcabb076bcc731d69f3da22ead0b57.png","width":945,"height":633,"width_mm":40.01,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图8"}],"choices":[[{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F\\Delta v}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{2}R}{G}"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F\\Delta v}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{3}T}{2\\pi G}"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F\\Delta t}{\\Delta v}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{3}R}{G}"}],[{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F\\Delta t}{\\Delta v}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{3}T}{2\\pi G}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】根据牛顿第二定律可知F=ma=m"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以m="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F\\Delta t}{\\Delta v}"},{"type":"text","value":"，飞船做匀速圆周运动的周期T="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2\\pi r}{v}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得轨道半径为r="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Tv}{2\\pi}"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据万有引力提供向心力可得G"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Mm}{r^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"=m"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得M="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{2}r}{G}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{3}T}{2\\pi G}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故选项D正确．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q13","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c35aad870bb3adab27025d1f3940d4c7514b2585aa243eaa8d6c9b21765f7be3","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图9所示为某一游戏的局部简化示意图．D为弹射装置，AB是长为21 m的水平轨道，倾斜直轨道BC固定在竖直放置的半径为R=10 m的圆形支架上，B为圆形的最低点，轨道AB与BC平滑连接，且在同一竖直平面内，某次游戏中，无动力小车在弹射装置D的作用下，以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"=10 m/s的速度滑上轨道AB，并恰好能冲到轨道BC的最高点．已知小车在轨道AB上受到的摩擦力为其重量的0.2倍，轨道BC光滑，则小车从A到C的运动时间是(g取 10 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":")（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a52b8099d2c143f99127ad12500d545460d2ee30c21fb3306c33363fa45811bd.png","width":1417,"height":362,"width_mm":59.9,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图9"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"5 s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"4.8 s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"4.4 s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"3 s"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】小车在轨道AB上运动的加速度大小为a=μg=2 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{AB}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"-"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"at"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=3 s(另一值7 s舍去)，在轨道BC上运动时，"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{BC}"},{"type":"text","value":"=2Rsin "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，加速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=gsin "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，将小车在轨道BC上的运动看作逆向的初速度为0的匀加速直线运动，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{BC}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"t"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=2 s，所以小车从A到C的运动时间为t="},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"+"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=5 s."}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q14","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a2f7a50a6700d1aa4cf330dca57e474ca11b0c725cf938d964939d52d9b27087","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【加试题】处于较高能级的氢原子向较低能级跃迁时，能辐射出a、b两种可见光，a光照射某金属表面时有光电子逸出，b光照射该金属表面时没有光电子逸出，则（填空）"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"以相同的入射角射向一平行玻璃砖，a光的侧移量小于b光的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"垂直入射到同一单缝衍射装置，a光的衍射中央亮条纹宽度小于b光的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"a光和b光的频率之比可能是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{20}{27}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"a光子的动量大于b光子的"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】由题意可知，a光可使某金属发生光电效应，b光不能，则有频率"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":">"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，C错误；同种介质中的折射率"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":">"},{"type":"math","value":"n_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，在玻璃砖中的侧移量"},{"type":"math","value":"y_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":">"},{"type":"math","value":"y_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A错误；波长"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"，单缝衍射时的中央亮条纹宽度a光比b光小，B正确；光子的动量为p="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{h}{\\lambda}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以a光子的动量大于b光子的动量，D正确．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q15","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7f8ae412c1ac0ef3f737fb985cba61a3bb18e93df40b6246c171bab0b761e5b7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【加试题】一个铍原子核("},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{4}^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"Be)俘获一个核外电子(通常是最靠近原子核的K壳层的电子)后发生衰变，生成一个锂核("},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{3}^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"Li)，并放出一个不带电的质量接近零的中微子"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"，人们把这种衰变称为“K俘获”．静止的铍核发生了“K俘获”，其核反应方程为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{4}^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"Be+"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{-1}^{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"e"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rightarrow"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{3}^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"Li+"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n已知铍原子的质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"M_{Be}"},{"type":"text","value":"=7.016 929 u，锂原子的质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"M_{Li}"},{"type":"text","value":"=7.016 004 u,1 u相当于9.31×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" MeV.下列说法正确的是（填空）"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"中微子的质量数和电荷数均为零"}],[{"type":"text","value":"锂核("},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{3}^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"Li)获得的动能约为0.86 MeV"}],[{"type":"text","value":"中微子与锂核("},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{3}^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"Li)的动量之和等于反应前电子的动量"}],[{"type":"text","value":"中微子与锂核("},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{3}^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"Li)的能量之和等于反应前电子的能量"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q16","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"12ef10bb077456f22f1471a7413a5d5b1564d380f658b320bcac0c4f41ce1506","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【加试题】如图10所示，两种不同材料的弹性细绳在O处连接，M、O和N是该绳上的三个点，OM间距离为7.0 m，ON间距离为5.0 m，O点上下振动，则形成以O点为波源向左和向右传播的简谐横波Ⅰ和Ⅱ，其中波Ⅱ的波速为1.0 m/s.t=0时刻O点处在波谷位置，观察发现5 s后此波谷传到M点，此时O点正通过平衡位置向上运动，OM间还有一个波谷，则（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7dbe0fcd7a05289ae49e870e2577fb5f69a0c27099f51f2026f7065f99928087.png","width":902,"height":194,"width_mm":38.1,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图10"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"波Ⅰ的波长为4 m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"N点振动周期为4 s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"t=3 s时，N点恰好处于波谷"}],[{"type":"text","value":"当M点处于波峰时，N点也一定处于波峰"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】由题意知，OM间的距离为1.25"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{L}{1.25}"},{"type":"text","value":"=5.6 m，A错误；O点的振动周期为T，则1.25T=5 s，所以T=4 s，故N点的周期也为4 s，B正确；由于波Ⅱ的波速为1 m/s，所以波长为4 m，t=0时，N点正处在平衡位置向下振动，所以t=3 s时N点处于波峰，C错误；波Ⅰ、波Ⅱ的振动周期相同，且t=0时，M点、N点都处在平衡位置向下振动，所以振动步调一致，当M在波峰时，N点也在波峰，D正确．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q17","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cb0825d019df320b90c52c242acfa0061f8bc5a30f8d24a631cbce069bc71b1f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"(1)在“探究求合力的方法”的实验中，下列操作正确的是（填空）．\nA．在使用弹簧秤时，使弹簧秤与木板平面平行\nB．每次拉伸橡皮筋时，只要使橡皮筋伸长量相同即可\nC．橡皮筋应与两绳夹角的平分线在同一直线上\nD．描点确定拉力方向时，两点之间的距离应尽可能大一些\n(2)在“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”的实验中，两个相同的小车放在光滑水平板上，前端各系一条细绳，绳的另一端跨过定滑轮各挂一个小盘，盘中可放重物．小车的停和动通过用黑板擦按住小车后的细线和抬起来控制，如图11甲所示．实验要求小盘和重物所受的重力近似等于使小车做匀加速直线运动的力．\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b20e3d1c8850945e6e46242dda66be1eafd02e76397fedb988eca5047a1c1a9f.png","width":1209,"height":380,"width_mm":51.22,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q17-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/02c1c73ac00b5276d3626ab010840513d8546c9adb15d027c87ade4fb8785c72.png","width":1405,"height":579,"width_mm":59.48,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q17-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图11\n①请指出图乙中错误之处：（填空）；\n②调整好实验装置后，在某次实验中测得两小车的位移分别是"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则两车的加速度之比为（填空）．"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)AD (2)①拉小车的细绳与水平板没有平行 托盘和重物的总质量没有远小于小车的质量 ②"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"："},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】(1)做“探究求合力的方法”的实验中弹簧秤应与木板平面平行，A正确；每次拉伸橡皮筋时，应保证橡筋的伸长方向和伸长量相同，即保证结点在同一位置，B错误；拉橡皮筋时不一定要使橡皮筋的拉伸方向在两绳夹角的平分线上，C错误；描点确定拉力方向时，两点间的距离应适当大些，以减小作图时的误差，故D正确．\n(2)细绳拉力方向应与水平板平行，以保证小车受到恒力的作用，从而加速度恒定，如果不平行，则随着小车的运动，小车水平方向的拉力会发生变化，同时根据题意“小盘和重物所受的重力近似等于使小车做匀加速直线运动的力”可知，只有当托盘和重物的质量远小于小车质量时，才可以近似把小车受到的拉力约等于托盘和重物的重力．根据x="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"a"},{"type":"math","value":"t^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可知，两车同时释放，同时停止，加速度之比等于位移之比．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q18","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"实验题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"53542a8be2178b1ef49cb98eaf6907fc70041e3904af4d9ab78e54b12b50a556","body":[{"type":"text","value":"为了比较精确地测定阻值未知的定值电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"，小明设计了如图12（1）所示的电路．\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/89a412c1f55641d543231dbfa351f73881bf09d5d9152408032ae031f773b17e.png","width":729,"height":571,"width_mm":30.9,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图12（1）\n(1)实验时，闭合开关S，滑动变阻器的滑片滑至合适位置保持不变，将c点先后与a、b点连接，发现电压表示数变化较大，电流表示数基本不变，则测量时应将c点接（填空）(选填“a点”或“b点”)，按此连接测量，测量结果（填空）(选填“小于”、“等于”或“大于”)"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"的真实值．\n(2)根据实验测得的6组数据，在图12（2）中描点，作出了2条图线，你认为正确的是（填空）(选填“①”或“②”)，并由图线求出电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"=（填空） Ω.(保留两位有效数字)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d43d25381bb96b8c893678bfa9b3512f4f80f96c6db1e6ab04a2b43de7b92a2b.png","width":1217,"height":942,"width_mm":51.44,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图12（2）"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1) a点 小于 (2)② 7.5\n【详解】(1)由题中表述知，c先后与a、b试触，电压表示数变化比较大，故电流表的电阻对电路影响比较大，所以应该使用电流表外接法，即接a点，由R="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U}{I}"},{"type":"text","value":"知测量值比真实值偏小．\n(2)根据电路的接法，当电流为零时电压表示数也为0，故图线过原点，选②，由I-U图象的斜率的倒数即为电阻阻值可知"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"=7.5 Ω."}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q19","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5d62e864c580556497ebbd3a37ed7a4129c5c92b5fbfb272be3b9f02fa890ea7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"在竖直平面内，某一游戏轨道由直轨道AB和弯曲的细管道BCD平滑连接组成，如图13所示，小滑块以某一初速度从A点滑上倾角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"=37°的直轨道AB，到达B点的速度大小为2 m/s，然后进入细管道BCD，从细管道出口D点水平飞出，落到水平面上的G点．已知B点的高度"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=1.2 m，D点的高度"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=0.8 m，D点与G点间的水平距离L=0.4 m，滑块与轨道AB间的动摩擦因数μ=0.25，sin 37°=0.6，cos 37°=0.8，g取10 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，不计空气阻力．\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c1e4a85e160bee75b421c2004efdd9ceb9f850e683af5b114db1d8a15d0eb5a4.png","width":1554,"height":585,"width_mm":65.83,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图13\n(1)求小滑块在轨道AB上的加速度和在A点的初速度；\n(2)求小滑块从D点飞出的速度；\n(3)判断细管道BCD的内壁是否光滑．"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】见解析\n【详解】(1)取AB段研究，滑块在AB上做匀减速运动\n设初速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则v"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"-v"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{A}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=-2ax\na="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{mgsin \\theta +\\mu mgcos \\theta}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nx="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{h_{1}}{\\sin \\theta}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"=6 m/s(方向沿轨道AB向上)，a=8 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(方向沿轨道AB向下)\n(2)取DG段研究，滑块做平抛运动，竖直方向"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"g"},{"type":"math","value":"t^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，水平方向L="},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D1}"},{"type":"text","value":"t，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=1 m/s\n(3)取BD段研究，假设BD段光滑，根据机械能守恒定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{D2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"-"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=mg("},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"-"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":")，则\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=2"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" m/s"},{"type":"math","value":"\\ne"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D1}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因此细管道BCD的内壁不是光滑的．"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811-q20","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201811","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201811-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3bd1e0e624b91cd781b8f1b076a7031415d4fd9005054b4b82fd4b20d440a685","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图14所示，在地面上竖直固定了刻度尺和轻质弹簧，弹簧原长时上端与刻度尺上的A点等高．质量m=0.5 kg的篮球静止在弹簧正上方，其底端距A点的高度"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=1.10 m，篮球静止释放，测得第一次撞击弹簧时，弹簧的最大形变量"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=0.15 m，第一次反弹至最高点，篮球底端距A点的高度"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=0.873 m，篮球多次反弹后静止在弹簧的上端，此时弹簧的形变量"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=0.01 m，弹性势能为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{p}"},{"type":"text","value":"=0.025 J．若篮球运动时受到的空气阻力大小恒定，忽略篮球与弹簧碰撞时的能量损失和篮球形变，弹簧形变在弹性限度范围内，g取10 m/"},{"type":"math","value":"s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":".求：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/991f84ea3f478a35544f58126d60b525aefe62c10fc578f51983c0cfdec02069.png","width":450,"height":528,"width_mm":19.05,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201811-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图14\n(1)弹簧的劲度系数；\n(2)篮球在运动过程中受到的空气阻力；\n(3)篮球在整个运动过程中通过的路程；\n(4)篮球在整个运动过程中速度最大的位置．"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)500 N/m (2)0.5 N\n(3)11.05 m (4)第一次下落至A点下方0.009 m处速度最大\n【详解】(1)由最后静止的位置可知k"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=mg，所以k=500 N/m\n(2)由动能定理可知，在篮球由静止下落到第一次返弹至最高点的过程中\nmg"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta"},{"type":"text","value":"h-"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"·L="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"-"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n整个过程动能变化为0，重力做功mg"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta"},{"type":"text","value":"h=mg("},{"type":"math","va